# Code Owners
# GitHub will automatically request review from these owners when a PR
# touches files in their area.
# Syntax: <pattern>  <@github-username or @org/team>

# Global fallback – everything requires owner review
*                           @your-github-username

# Next.js Source Code
src/                        @your-github-username
public/                     @your-github-username

# Database Schema & Migrations
schema.sql                  @your-github-username
supabase/                   @your-github-username

# CI/CD – workflows & configurations
.github/                    @your-github-username

# Root config files
package.json                @your-github-username
package-lock.json           @your-github-username
tsconfig.json               @your-github-username
next.config.ts              @your-github-username
vercel.json                 @your-github-username

